BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:AVL Writers
UID:event_316505711@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045038Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T200000
SUMMARY:Weekly Critique
DESCRIPTION:AVL Writers\nThis is the standing weekly critique. Bring anyth
 ing new you're working on to share with the group. If you don't have a pro
 ject to share\, you are most welcome to attend\, discuss\, and get inspire
 d.\n\nFor our group discussion\, please bring at least 8-10 printed copies
  of your piece. That way\, we can all read through each other's work and p
 rovide feedback.\n\nSharing our creative efforts is an important part of t
 he writing process. I'm really looking forward to reading what you've been
  working on. Don't worry if it's still a rough draft.\n\nIf you're having 
 trouble finding us\, look for a placard on the table with the group's name
 .\n\nIf you would like to join our group email list for updates regarding 
 contests\, events\, and more [you can sign up on our website](https://avlw
 riters.com/).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-writers/events/316505711/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260910T222921Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T222921Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
